    {
      "type": "spotlight",
      "item": "tribalpower:echo_attune",
      "text": [
        "Echo Attune (Fire) turns Echo Shards into **Attuned Echoes**. Its partner, Echo Bind (Water), turns Attuned Echoes into **Bound Echoes**.",
        "These are the middle steps of the lattice: materials for better machines, and stronger crystals for your Pulse Resonator."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Attune",
      "text": [
        "Place Echo Attune with a Fire totem within 8 blocks and feed it Echo Shards. Each becomes an Attuned Echo in **3 seconds** at **20 Pulse a second** before pack settings.",
        "Attune also turns an Amethyst Shard into a Spirit Shard.",
        "Trophies from March creatures, such as an Ember Heart, a Reed Fang or a Rift Tooth, attune into **two** Attuned Echoes each, but those need the **Spirit** voice, not Fire."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Bind",
      "text": [
        "Place Echo Bind with a Water totem within 8 blocks and feed it Attuned Echoes. Each becomes a Bound Echo in **4 seconds** at **24 Pulse a second** before pack settings.",
        "Bind also turns wool into **Spiritweave**, and dirt into **four clay balls**. Soft creature drops such as Dawn Velvet, Lantern Down or Storm Wing bind into two Spiritweave each."
      ]
    },
